tree Work in a box

box ledger as Ledger

step Add leaves
  say Add two leaves.
  leaf tx1 [hash: 3fa0]
  leaf tx2 [hash: 8b04]

step Check
  say act shows work happening inside a box without adding a box.
  act ledger: Check the values

step Join
  say The tree can grow again after the work.
  node root of tx1, tx2 [hash: 7a21]
